\item[S2] Open Problem Garden, Multicolour Erdős--Hajnal Conjecture, node 60042, original problem page. Original question and full discussion. \url{https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/multicolour_erdos_hajnal_conjecture}.
\item[S3] Maria Axenovich and Lea Weber, A note on multicolour Erdős--Hajnal conjecture (2023), Section 1, definitions of a copy and a homogeneous set. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2311.03249}.
